<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLE RESULTS (1900 GMT).</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN DOUBLE RESULTS (1900 GMT).</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Double results on the 11th day of</p>
<p>the French Open tennis tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>16-Rika Hiraki (Japan)/Mahesh Bhupathi (India) beat 4-Helena</p>
<p>Sukova/Cyril Suk (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>1-Lisa Raymond/Patrick Galbraith (U.S.) beat 3-Manon Bollegraf</p>
<p>(Netherlands)/Rick Leach (U.S.) 4-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)/Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat 2-Jacco Eltingh/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 7-6 (7-4) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Lucas</p>
<p>Arnold/Daniel Orsanic (Argentina) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>(Ends double results)</p>
</text>
